{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Factory Life",
    "steam_appid": 3462580,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wondered what it's like to work in an electronics factory? \ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udfed Now you can experience it! \u26a1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Factory Life</strong></i>, you play as an ordinary worker assembling, testing, and packing equipment\u2014all under tight deadlines and a demanding boss. \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Complete orders to earn money, but mistakes cost you both wages and factory progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in a small, neglected workshop and build it into a thriving plant\u2014your precision and dedication determine success! \ud83c\udfed Ensure the factory's growth and secure a better future for your family. \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features of the game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0b<strong>First-person experience of working on the production line</strong> - immerse yourself in a realistic simulation of work in a factory, from assembling electronic devices, through testing their operation, to final packing of orders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/cbd9daccd280db7f6ef2544ca2575205.poster.avif?t=1752747088\" width=600 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/cbd9daccd280db7f6ef2544ca2575205.webm?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/cbd9daccd280db7f6ef2544ca2575205.mp4?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfed<strong>Gradual development of the factory</strong> - each job well done allows you to unlock new positions, better equipment and larger orders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/e0a24a22e30d3b0777495d3a5b23dbb6.poster.avif?t=1752747088\" width=600 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/e0a24a22e30d3b0777495d3a5b23dbb6.webm?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/e0a24a22e30d3b0777495d3a5b23dbb6.mp4?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/021a27edeb544a4bbd8293376c98f293.poster.avif?t=1752747088\" width=600 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/021a27edeb544a4bbd8293376c98f293.webm?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/021a27edeb544a4bbd8293376c98f293.mp4?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf1<strong>Various orders</strong> - a new game has come out and you need graphics cards? Or maybe a new smartphone was launched? All of these devices are manufactured in an electronics factory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/031a88d680f445ee9b507bf17e3cea9c.poster.avif?t=1752747088\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/031a88d680f445ee9b507bf17e3cea9c.webm?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/031a88d680f445ee9b507bf17e3cea9c.mp4?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/0050523a1f4d8e15d12aa7c31fe849e4.poster.avif?t=1752747088\" width=600 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/0050523a1f4d8e15d12aa7c31fe849e4.webm?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/0050523a1f4d8e15d12aa7c31fe849e4.mp4?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udfed<strong>Realistic factory work simulation</strong> - feel like an employee of a small factory who, like a one-man army, deals with various aspects of work on the production line, must keep up with deadlines and support a family. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/d1b22fed9b421103b6f5e2e13aa1dcc2.poster.avif?t=1752747088\" width=600 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/d1b22fed9b421103b6f5e2e13aa1dcc2.webm?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/d1b22fed9b421103b6f5e2e13aa1dcc2.mp4?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8<strong>Growing challenges</strong> \u2013 the more orders, the greater the pressure. Maintain high quality of work and avoid mistakes to earn as much money as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/e615c2288394931236ed6ee8e3ad8ca2.poster.avif?t=1752747088\" width=600 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/e615c2288394931236ed6ee8e3ad8ca2.webm?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/e615c2288394931236ed6ee8e3ad8ca2.mp4?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you up to the challenge?\ud83d\udcaa</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wondered what it's like to work in an electronics factory? \ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udfed Now you can experience it! \u26a1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Factory Life</strong></i>, you play as an ordinary worker assembling, testing, and packing equipment\u2014all under tight deadlines and a demanding boss. \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Complete orders to earn money, but mistakes cost you both wages and factory progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in a small, neglected workshop and build it into a thriving plant\u2014your precision and dedication determine success! \ud83c\udfed Ensure the factory's growth and secure a better future for your family. \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features of the game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0b<strong>First-person experience of working on the production line</strong> - immerse yourself in a realistic simulation of work in a factory, from assembling electronic devices, through testing their operation, to final packing of orders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/cbd9daccd280db7f6ef2544ca2575205.poster.avif?t=1752747088\" width=600 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/cbd9daccd280db7f6ef2544ca2575205.webm?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/cbd9daccd280db7f6ef2544ca2575205.mp4?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfed<strong>Gradual development of the factory</strong> - each job well done allows you to unlock new positions, better equipment and larger orders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/e0a24a22e30d3b0777495d3a5b23dbb6.poster.avif?t=1752747088\" width=600 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/e0a24a22e30d3b0777495d3a5b23dbb6.webm?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/e0a24a22e30d3b0777495d3a5b23dbb6.mp4?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/021a27edeb544a4bbd8293376c98f293.poster.avif?t=1752747088\" width=600 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/021a27edeb544a4bbd8293376c98f293.webm?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/021a27edeb544a4bbd8293376c98f293.mp4?t=1752747088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf1<strong>Various orders</strong> - a new game has come out and you need graphics cards? Or maybe a new smartphone was launched? All of these devices are manufactured in an electronics factory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/031a88d680f445ee9b507bf17e3cea9c.poster.avif?t=1752747088\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/031a88d680f445ee9b507bf17e3ce